Description: Single-binary experiment tracker, MLflow-compatible, with LLM trace support
 LiteMLflow is a lightweight, self-hosted experiment tracker for solo ML
 engineers and small teams. Single binary, MLflow-API-compatible, with
 first-class LLM trace support.
 .
 No database to install. No object store to configure. No reverse proxy.
